{"id":"varo_n","lemma":"varón","pos":"noun","rank":3775,"glosses":["person of male sex"],"ipa":"/baˈɾon/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"varones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-var%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tiene siete hijos varones.","en":"She has seven sons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448771","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"seven"},{"g":"son","l":"hijo"},null]},{"text":"\"¿Cuántos niños varones tienes?\" \"Solo tengo uno.\"","en":"\"How many boys do you have?\" \"I only have one.\"","words":[{"g":"how much","l":"cuánto"},{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"one"}]},{"text":"Tom no tuvo ningún heredero varón.","en":"Tom had no male heir.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804252","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"heir"},null]},{"text":"El sospechoso es un varón de raza negra.","en":"The suspect is a black male.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642159","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"suspicious"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null,{"g":"crotchet, quarter note"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"pedigree"]]},{"text":"El grupo estaba compuesto por cuatro jóvenes varones.","en":"The group was made up of four young men.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"group"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"compound, composite"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a four-stringed guitar…"},{"g":"young, youthful","l":"joven"},null]}]}